001.steps:
1. Rules and Policies - DNS Rules, enable a DNS Policy : Action-Filter, Profile-Default Profile, Interface-X0;
 2. Device - Log - Settings - Network - DNS Security, enable 'DNS Filtering - DNS Packet Allowed', accept;
 3. Device - Log - Settings, set Logging level to Inform, click edit, set Display Events in Log Monitor to 0 seconds, accept;
 4. PC connected to X0, set dns server as X0 IP, do dig www.baidu.com; 
 5. Do packet capture on DUT, check DNS packets;
6. Check logs in Monitor - Logs - System Logs.

002.steps:
1. Profile Objects - DNS Filtering, add a profile named "test", the action of category "Adult", "Gaming", "Gambling", "Malware" is Allow;
 2. Rules and Policies - DNS Rules, enable a DNS Policy : Action-Filter, Interface-X0, Profile-"test";
3. In Device - Log - Settings page, set Logging level to Inform, click edit, set Display Events in Log Monitor to 0 seconds, enable log 'DNS Filtering - DNS Packet Allowed' in Network - DNS Security, accept;
4. PC connected to X0, set dns server as X0 IP, do 'dig adultswim.com';
5. Do packet capture on DUT, check DNS packets, and check log in Monitor - Logs - System Logs;
6. From PC, do 'dig www.ea.com', repeat step 5;
7. From PC, do 'dig www.gamblingsites.org', repeat step 5;
8. From PC, do 'dig www.hjaoopoa.top', repeat step 5.

003.steps:
1. Profile Objects - DNS Filtering, add a profile named "test", the action of category "Phishing", "Pornography", "Anonymous Proxies", "Social", "Bots/C2" is Block;
 2. Rules and Policies - DNS Rules, enable a DNS Policy : Action-Filter, Interface-X0, Profile-"test";
 3. In Device - Log - Settings page, click edit, set Display Events in Log Monitor to 0 seconds, set Logging level to Inform, enable log 'DNS Filtering - DNS Packet Dropped' in Network - DNS Security,  accept;
4. PC connected to X0, set dns server as X0 IP, do 'dig iomovies.to';
 5. Do packet capture on DUT, check DNS packets, and log in Monitor - Logs - System Logs;
6. From PC, do 'dig myfreecams.com', repeat step 5;
7. From PC, do 'dig sitenable.ch', repeat step 5;
8. From PC, do 'dig loveread.me', repeat step 5;    9. From PC, do 'dig ultradnsfirewall-bots.neustar', repeat step 5.

