005.steps:
1. Profile Objects - DNS Filtering, add a profile named "test", the action of category "Dating", "Drugs", "Alcohol", "Discrimination/Hate", "Ransomware"  is Forged IP Reply;
2. Rules and Policies - DNS Rules, enable a DNS Policy : Action-Filter, Interface-X0, Profile-"test", then in DNS Security page, set the Forged IPv4 is 127.0.0.2, Forged IPv6 is 1001::2;
3. In Device - Log - Settings page, click edit, set Display Events in Log Monitor to 0 seconds, set Logging level to Inform, enable 'DNS Filtering - DNS Packet Dropped' in Network - DNS Security, accept;
